Package: delphyr
Title: Reproducible Round-Based Delphi Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Supports round-based Delphi studies with validated study
    protocols, deterministic consensus classification, longitudinal analysis
    across rounds and transactional services backed by 'PostgreSQL'. Frozen
    round snapshots can be analyzed offline, without a database, and research
    exports can be reproduced from their files. Synthetic example studies are
    included. Production use requires the documented security and operational
    acceptance gates.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
SystemRequirements: Optional: PostgreSQL (tested with version 17) for the
    study services; Quarto for rendered HTML study reports.
Imports: DBI, digest, jsonlite (>= 1.8.8), openssl, uuid
Suggests: RPostgres, callr, withr, pkgload, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/delphyR
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/delphyR/issues
Config/Needs/website: CTTIR/themakR, pkgdown
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
